# Web tools

`web/` is a pnpm workspace package. Run it from the **repo root**: `pnpm install`, `pnpm dev`, `pnpm build`.

Campaign notes stay in `docs/`. Do not put lore in the Next.js app. New tools are App Router routes plus a card on the home tools list.
